<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Electric says '96 sales up 12.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Manila Electric says '96 sales up 12.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Electric Co, the largest electricity distributor in the Philippines, said on Monday its sales rose by 12.2 percent to 17.81 billion kilowatt-hours (kwh) in 1996.</p>
</text>
